  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "cbct_projection",
  "identifier": "10.57967/hf/9369",
  "description": "This is a CBCT projection dataset. \nIt consists of CBCT projection data of brain, head and neck, lungs, prostate, and pancreas cases. \nThe projection data were acquired using 3 CBCT systems (XVI Elekta, Varian Truebeam, and IBA Toshiba).\nYou can find Python scripts to download, read, and visualize the data in the following GitHub repository: https://github.com/MedIP-HKU/CBCT_projection.\nThe repository also contains a Python script to reconstruct the CBCT images using Reconstruction Toolkit\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/hku-mip/cbct_projection.",
